 stories of a gigantic sea monster inhabiting these dangerous waters. Rumors say it can be 13 m long."},{"id":"marker77","name":"Penkneth Monster","legend":"Old sailors tell stories of a gigantic sea monster inhabiting these dangerous waters. Rumors say it can be 10 m long."},{"id":"marker78","name":"Stans Monster","legend":"Old sailors tell stories of a gigantic sea monster inhabiting these dangerous waters. Rumors say it can be 37 m long."},{"id":"marker79","name":"Kaurinenlin Bearded Devil","legend":"Tales speak of a superior Bearded Devil who inhabits Kaurinenlin hills and terrorizes the region."},{"id":"marker80","name":"Ditamia Hydra","legend":"Legends speak of a terrifying Hydra who inhabits Ditamia hills and eats kids whole."},{"id":"marker81","name":"Vathonia Ogre","legend":"Inscriptions speak of a great Ogre who inhabits Vathonia hills and attacks anyone who dares to approach its lair."},{"id":"marker82","name":"Plentziakio Vampire","legend":"Whispers speak of a big Vampire who inhabits Plentziakio hills and harasses travelers in the area."},{"id":"marker83","name":"Louteginata Forest","legend":"A forest sacred to local Sect of the Four."},{"id":"marker84","name":"Kragorannar Forest","legend":"A forest sacred to local Gods of the Distant."},{"id":"marker85","name":"Lemeli Forest","legend":"A forest sacred to local Sect of the Four."},{"id":"marker86","name":"Tucananoma Forest","legend":"A forest sacred to local Blescavenese Gods."},{"id":"marker87","name":"Mastodute Forest","legend":"A forest sacred to local Sect of the Four."},{"id":"marker88","name":"Cidinodunum Forest","legend":"A forest sacred to local Sect of the Four."},{"id":"marker89","name":"Tolissospon Forest","legend":"A forest sacred to local Leineiapate Gods."},{"id":"marker90","name":"Phosiatea Pinery","legend":"A pinery sacred to local Leineiapate Gods."},{"id":"marker91","name":"Uldiskog Palm Grove","legend":"A palm grove sacred to local Pohlam Deities."},{"id":"marker92","name":"Rolesham Palm Grove","legend":"A palm grove sacred to local Seran Deities."},{"id":"marker93","name":"Askuerrekei Palm Grove","legend":"A palm grove sacred to local Zurism."},{"id":"marker94","name":"Exandnaly Panthers","legend":"A gang of forest bandits."},{"id":"marker95","name":"Tauvaloli Beavers","legend":"A gang of forest brigands."},{"id":"marker96","name":"Nigripi Dogs","legend":"A gang of swamp brigands."},{"id":"marker97","name":"Agrinoryst Hawks","legend":"A gang of forest brigands."},{"id":"marker98","name":"Lugrum Dogs","legend":"A gang of forest robbers."},{"id":"marker99","name":"Pregullum Sharks","legend":"A gang of forest bandits."},{"id":"marker100","name":"Risipoce Panthers","legend":"A gang of swamp bandits."},{"id":"marker101","name":"Pirates","legend":"Pirate ships have been spotted in these waters."},{"id":"marker102","name":"Pirates","legend":"Pirate ships have been spotted in these waters."},{"id":"marker103","name":"Pirates","legend":"Pirate ships have been spotted in these waters."},{"id":"marker104","name":"Pirates","legend":"Pirate ships have been spotted in these waters."},{"id":"marker105","name":"Pirates","legend":"Pirate ships have been spotted in these waters."},{"id":"marker106","name":"Pirates","legend":"Pirate ships have been spotted in these waters."},{"id":"marker107","name":"Pirates","legend":"Pirate ships have been spotted in these waters."},{"id":"marker108","name":"Pirates","legend":"Pirate ships have been spotted in these waters."},{"id":"marker109","name":"Pirates","legend":"Pirate ships have been spotted in these waters."},{"id":"marker110","name":"Pirates","legend":"Pirate ships have been spotted in these waters."},{"id":"marker111","name":"Pirates","legend":"Pirate ships have been spotted in these waters."},{"id":"marker112","name":"Vicrinolo Monument","legend":"An ancient monument. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">༐༼༴༔༱༻༖༪༛༕༲་་༫༌༣༾༛༜༳༫༬༌༖༪༫༾༺་༬༬༑༾༜༵༔༳༇༑༔༵༵༫༛༬༶༂༗༯༈༈༢༑༆༜༑༗༈༚༕༣༌༨༜༂༅༬༼༫༰༕༴༩༰༬༱༩༚༹༚</div>"},{"id":"marker113","name":"Winve Sculpture","legend":"An ancient sculpture. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\"> ⳥ⲲⳂⲲⳔⳌⲼⳫ⳧⳹ⳆⳆⳭⳃⲺⲲⳫ⳾ⳜⲾⳊⳖⳆ ⳚⳒⳁⳚⳞⳭ⳾Ⳏ ⳞⲼⳬⳄ⳹ⳆⳎⳖⲺⳚⳊⳤⳒⳤⲸⳃⳬⳢ⳩ⳭⳃⳖⲾⲺⳫⳔⳘⲴ⳧⳪ⳔⳖⳂ</div>"},{"id":"marker114","name":"Kushk Megalith","legend":"An ancient megalith. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">⳾ⳁ⳹ⲲⳂⳃⳊⳒ ⳫⲾⳈⲼⳠⳠⳊⳖ ⳁⳒ ⳎⳌⳤⳊ ⳩ⳲⳖ⳥Ⳑ⳧ⳖⳁⳘⳠⳤⳚⳤⳒⳐⳤⲶⳁⳆⳞⳊⳫⲾⳖⳐⳈⳢⲾⳊⳚⳘ⳾ⳫⳚ⳪ⳊⲲⳎ</div>"},{"id":"marker115","name":"Hinma Sculpture","legend":"An ancient sculpture. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">𐠥\ud802\ud802𐠖𐠞𐠗𐠒𐠐\udc14 \udc23𐠚\udc03\udc1f\ud802𐠦\udc05\ud802\ud802𐠬\ud802\ud802𐠕𐠗\udc2d𐠰𐠈\ud802𐠷\ud802 \ud802𐠚\udc35\udc35\ud802𐠯\udc30\udc28\ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802𐠦 \udc19\udc20\ud802\ud802𐠈\ud802\ud802</div>"},{"id":"marker116","name":"Debarteani Pillar","legend":"An ancient pillar. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ༀ༳༗༻༁༸༁༢༰༳༪༛༧༒༱༾༚༗༂༤༓༔༥༷༕༺༣༜༊༠༑༊༂༖༳༇༿༅༛༇༩༕༆༓༘༐༹༔༑༬༳༜༄</div>"},{"id":"marker117","name":"Vaameresi Megalith","legend":"An ancient megalith. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ᠪᢜᢀᠯ᠑ᢁᢂᡕᡀᡖᢐᡭᡁᡮᡐᡕᡠᠳᠨᡖᢑᡞᡓᡖᢑᡁᡐᢓᢒᡑᠭᢥᡕᡭᢋᡁᢠᢓᡱᠽᢤᠾᡳᡓᢓᠮᠰᠭᡓᢓᢤ</div>"},{"id":"marker118","name":"Rakka Monument","legend":"An ancient monument. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">𐠫𐠅\ud802𐠖 𐠰𐠡𐠈\ud802\ud802  \ud802 \udc34\udc11\udc19\udc2f \udc29\udc0c𐠵 \udc2e𐠡𐠝\ud802\ud802\ud802𐠢\udc02\udc1f 𐠃\ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802𐠅\udc03𐠅 \ud802𐠊\ud802\ud802𐠿\udc11\udc21\udc33\udc31𐠸\ud802\ud802\ud802𐠰\ud802\ud802\ud802𐠣</div>"},{"id":"marker119","name":"Aupietagus Pillar","legend":"An ancient pillar. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ᡟᡮᠿᠩᢏᠼᠻᡳᢑᠽᡑᠵᡝᢒᡔᢡᠮᠳᠡᡗᡲᠨᢛᡙᢂᡐᢤᡱᢠᡠ᠐ᠳᠻᠽᠯᡕᢡᢟᡙᡟᡐᢜᡴᠿᡍ᠒ᡟᢐᢓᢡᠽᡳᡒ᠑ᡙᠰᢀᠧᠪᠪᢋᡞᢁᢥᡞᡀᡆᠿᡖᢋᠽᢥᡎᡳᠧᠭᢛᠮᠻᠪᡱᠮᠽᡙᡯᠻᢀᢁᡠᠱᡏᡁ</div>"},{"id":"marker120","name":"Laurigor Pillar","legend":"An ancient pillar. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ⳀⳭ ⳁⲶⳭⲸⲼ⳥ⳀⳆⳀ ⳆⳭⳂ⳩ⳜⳆⳠⲴⳄⳬⳘⳈⳀⳚⳊⳔ⳾ⳎⳀⲾⳖⲼⳈⳊⲴⳤⳂⳌⲾ ⳫⳘⳬⳄⳊⳌⳭⲾⳖⳘⳂⳃⳚ⳥ⳢⲸ⳩ⳄⳞⳤⳬⳁⳲ⳥ⳎⲺⳲⳊⳫ⳩ⳊⳘⳫⳒⳒⳲⳘⳄⳀⲸⳚ⳾⳥ⳒⲼⳀⳂ⳥</div>"},{"id":"marker121","name":"Cornococob Effigy","legend":"An ancient effigy. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">\udc0e\ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802𐠴𐠳\udc2d\udc2c\udc0a𐠣\udc32\udc33𐠱\udc05𐠵\udc31\udc2d\udc0c\udc2f𐠗𐠝\udc34\udc05\ud802𐠘\udc30\ud802\ud802\ud802𐠨\udc3c\ud802 \ud802 \udc1f\udc35 \udc1a𐠱𐠃\ud802𐠁\ud802𐠳𐠴\udc33 \udc18𐠅\udc35\udc29\udc32𐠩</div>"},{"id":"marker122","name":"Drutegiovi Monument","legend":"An ancient monument. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">Ⲻ⳧ ⳩ⳄⳌ⳪ⳢⲸⲶⳂⳌⲺ⳩Ⲻ⳥ⳈⳒ  ⲶⳞⳬⳈⲲⳫⳐⲺⳢⲶⳫⳢⳬⳬⳜⳄ⳩Ⲹ⳪ ⳪Ⳃ⳥ⳃⳢⳔⳄ⳥ⳖⳄ⳩ⳌⳘⳈⳜⲾⳭⳔⳲⳊⳜⳀⳬⳭⳠ ⲴⳊⲶⳈⳢⳎⲸⳂⲸⲸⳒⳖⳌⳫⳬⳒⳒⳲ⳾Ⳇ</div>"},{"id":"marker123","name":"Chatig Pillar","legend":"An ancient pillar. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\"> ፐዘፈሰጰገገዘቀተወኀ ዐጸዐዘሐኀሰተዘበፈዐ ዘሐሐዐጠደአዘበመጸ ሀ ዐዐአገገአነወበተ መቀተኀደዐሀገሐገገነመጠበ ኀገሀቀዐሀጰ</div>"},{"id":"marker124","name":"Urmahal Idol","legend":"An ancient idol. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">༽༆༐༡༩༤༅༿༷༬༒༒༣༁༳༓༿༉༵༢༧༦༈༣༅་༙༖༈༇༽༴༌༮༵༦༣༴༤༂༢༂༛༿༃༈༺་་༃༼༔༆༛༌༰</div>"},{"id":"marker125","name":"Cortis Effigy","legend":"An ancient effigy. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">𐠃𐠃\ud802𐠿\ud802𐠪\ud802𐠮\udc22\udc0b𐠞\ud802𐠱\udc2b𐠴\ud802𐠏\ud802𐠘\ud802𐠢\udc08\udc14\ud802\ud802𐠭\udc03\ud802\ud802𐠟\udc1e𐠙𐠥\ud802\ud802𐠰\ud802\ud802𐠠\udc28\ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802 𐠝𐠄 \udc11\udc32\ud802\ud802\ud802𐠦𐠬\ud802</div>"},{"id":"marker126","name":"Ideta Megalith","legend":"An ancient megalith. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">Ⳕ ⳔⲲ⳥ⲾⳌ⳩ⳜⳬⳀ ⳩ⳜⳚ ⳤⳭⳤ⳹ⲲⳭ ⲾⳀⳈⲺⳭⳞⳎⳒⳠⳈⳊⳤⳐⳎⳊ⳩ Ⳇ⳪</div>"},{"id":"marker127","name":"Kobavar Obelisk","legend":"An ancient obelisk. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ⳎⳬⲸⳀⳤⳐⳜⳄ ⳀⳒⳔⳁⳈⳞ ⳞⳔⲼⳔ⳧Ⲳⳃ⳾ ⳢⳭⳬ ⳭⳢⳘⳃⲶⲼⲾⳚⳈⳄⳫ ⳚⲾⳆⲾⳁ⳹⳪ⳢⳆⳂⳘ⳥ⳤⲺ⳾Ⳙ ⳖⳆⲼⳎ</div>"},{"id":"marker128","name":"Ruined Settlement","legend":"Ruins of an ancient settlement. Untold riches may lie within."},{"id":"marker129","name":"Ruined Pyramid","legend":"Ruins of an ancient pyramid. Untold riches may lie within."},{"id":"marker130","name":"Ruined Sacred site","legend":"Ruins of an ancient sacred site. Untold riches may lie within."},{"id":"marker131","name":"Ruined Pyramid","legend":"Ruins of an ancient pyramid. Untold riches may lie within."},{"id":"marker132","name":"Ruined Fortification","legend":"Ruins of an ancient fortification. Untold riches may lie within."},{"id":"marker133","name":"Ruined Temple","legend":"Ruins of an ancient temple. Untold riches may lie within."},{"id":"marker134","name":"Ruined Fortress","legend":"Ruins of an ancient fortress. Untold riches may lie within."},{"id":"marker135","name":"Ruined Sacred site","legend":"Ruins of an ancient sacred site. Untold riches may lie within."},{"id":"marker136","name":"Ruined Outpost","legend":"Ruins of an ancient outpost. Untold riches may lie within."},{"id":"marker137","name":"Ruined Temple","legend":"Ruins of an ancient temple. Untold riches may lie within."},{"id":"marker138","name":"Ruined Mausoleum","legend":"Ruins of an ancient mausoleum. Untold riches may lie within."},{"id":"marker139","name":"Ruined Pyramid","legend":"Ruins of an ancient pyramid. Untold riches may lie within."},{"id":"marker140","name":"Ruined Castle","legend":"Ruins of an ancient castle. Untold riches may lie within."},{"id":"marker141","name":"Ruined Temple","legend":"Ruins of an ancient temple. Untold riches may lie within."},{"id":"marker142","name":"Ruined City","legend":"Ruins of an ancient city. Untold riches may lie within."},{"id":"marker143","name":"Ruined Pyramid","legend":"Ruins of an ancient pyramid. Untold riches may lie within."},{"id":"marker144","name":"Ruined Settlement","legend":"Ruins of an ancient settlement. Untold riches may lie within."},{"id":"marker145","name":"Ruined Stronghold","legend":"Ruins of an ancient stronghold. Untold riches may lie within."},{"id":"marker146","name":"Aberarth Archive","legend":"A vast collection of knowledge, including many rare and ancient tomes."},{"id":"marker147","name":"Travelling Extraordinary Circus","legend":"Roll up, roll up, this extraordinary circus is here for a limited time only."},{"id":"marker148","name":"Travelling Incomprehensible Circus","legend":"Roll up, roll up, this incomprehensible circus is here for a limited time only."},{"id":"marker149","name":"Travelling Extraordinary Circus","legend":"Roll up, roll up, this extraordinary circus is here for a limited time only."},{"id":"marker150","name":"Travelling Breathtaking Circus","legend":"Roll up, roll up, this breathtaking circus is here for a limited time only."},{"id":"marker151","name":"Travelling World-famous Circus","legend":"Roll up, roll up, this world-famous circus is here for a limited time only."},{"id":"marker152","name":"Travelling Unmissable Circus","legend":"Roll up, roll up, this unmissable circus is here for a limited time only."},{"id":"marker153","name":"Ojarvikyvas Tournament","legend":"Warriors from around the land gather for a tournament of might in Ojarvikyvas, with fame, fortune and favour on offer to the victor."},{"id":"marker154","name":"Nonianeagus Fair","legend":"A fair is being held in Nonianeagus, with all manner of local and foreign goods and services on offer."},{"id":"marker155","name":"Minor Jetty","legend":"A small location along the Metoniovia Fork to launch boats from sits here, along with a weary looking owner, willing to sell passage along the river."},{"id":"marker156","name":"Minor Jetty","legend":"A small location along the Lesosctum River to launch boats from sits here, along with a weary looking owner, willing to sell passage along the river."},{"id":"marker157","name":"Beavers migration","legend":"A huge group of beavers are migrating, whether part of their annual routine, or something more extraordinary."},{"id":"marker158","name":"Horses migration","legend":"A huge group of horses are migrating, whether part of their annual routine, or something more extraordinary."},{"id":"marker159","name":"Foxes migration","legend":"A huge group of foxes are migrating, whether part of their annual routine, or something more extraordinary."},{"id":"marker160","name":"Crows migration","legend":"A huge group of crows are migrating, whether part of their annual routine, or something more extraordinary."},{"id":"marker161","name":"Moversorium jubilee","legend":"A jubilee has been organised at Moversorium as a chance to gather the great and the good of the area together to be merry, make alliances and scheme around the crisis."},{"id":"marker162","name":"Peculiar mirage","legend":"This peculiar mirage has been luring travellers out of their way for eons."},{"id":"marker163","name":"Diaphanous mirage","legend":"This diaphanous mirage has been luring travellers out of their way for eons."},{"id":"marker164","name":"Distant mirage","legend":"This distant mirage has been luring travellers out of their way for eons."},{"id":"marker165","name":"Peculiar mirage","legend":"This peculiar mirage has been luring travellers out of their way for eons."},{"id":"marker166","name":"Diaphanous mirage","legend":"This diaphanous mirage has been luring travellers out of their way for eons."},{"id":"marker167","name":"Entrancing mirage","legend":"This entrancing mirage has been luring travellers out of their way for eons."},{"id":"marker168","name":"Diaphanous mirage","legend":"This diaphanous mirage has been luring travellers out of their way for eons."},{"id":"marker169","name":"Aerorendau Grotto","legend":"The Aerorendau Grotto. Locals claim that it is a good spot to hid treasure."},{"id":"marker170","name":"Leta Pit","legend":"The Leta Pit. Locals claim that it is totally empty."},{"id":"marker171","name":"Koleshehaq Graveyard","legend":"A towering necropolis adorned with macabre sculptures and guarded by formidable undead sentinels. Its ancient halls house the remains of fallen heroes, entombed alongside their cherished relics."},{"id":"marker172","name":"Choghesfana Sepulchre","legend":"A sprawling necropolis built within a labyrinthine network of catacombs. Its halls are lined with countless alcoves, each housing the remains of the departed, while the distant sound of rattling bones fills the air."},{"id":"marker173","name":"Gebocelovi Mausoleum","legend":"An eerie necropolis where nature intertwines with death. Overgrown tombstones are entwined by thorny vines, and mournful spirits wander among the fading petals of once-vibrant flowers."},{"id":"marker174","name":"Compound Graveyard","legend":"This cursed necropolis is veiled in perpetual twilight, perpetuating a sense of impending doom. Dark enchantments shroud the tombs, and the moans of anguished souls resound through its crumbling halls."},{"id":"marker175","name":"Random encounter","legend":"<div>You have encountered a character.</div><iframe src=\"https://deorum.vercel.app/encounter/25088\" width=\"375\" height=\"600\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin allow-popups\"></iframe>"},{"id":"marker176","name":"Random encounter","legend":"<div>You have encountered a character.</div><iframe src=\"https://deorum.vercel.app/encounter/13910\" wid